                            <comment id="16759604" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 4 Feb 2019 03:25:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed --disable-demo flat of Web agent.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16766855" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 13 Feb 2019 06:56:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Test failed:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I set &apos;-dd&apos; option on agent start&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;opened web console&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;click on Start Demo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Expected - some warning that demo is disabled&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actually - a typical confirmation of how I can start a demo&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12958520/12958520_image-2019-02-13-13-55-51-248.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16770737" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 18 Feb 2019 02:33:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16770762" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 18 Feb 2019 04:06:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Test failed - I didn&apos;t start any agent but got the error message&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12959041/12959041_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16770820" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 18 Feb 2019 07:00:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed launch of demo mode when agent in not connected to Web console.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16777059" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 25 Feb 2019 16:18:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
